            "author": "aiwithrachel",
            "region": "US",
            "shares": 1,
            "caption": "Negotiating for yourself is hard. Most of us are better at advocating for a friend than we are for ourselves. We second guess our value, soften our asks, and convince ourselves we’re asking for too much. That’s where AI has become one of my favorite thought partners. Before I send a negotiation email, I’ll ask AI to pressure test my reasoning, point out where I’m underselling myself, anticipate objections, and help me make a stronger case. Think of it as borrowing AI’s confidence until you fully trust your own. Whether it’s a salary, a contract, a refund, or even your internet bill, don’t negotiate alone. #negotiate #aiforcreators #aiforbeginners #aiprompts ",
